{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_9","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\WINDOWS\\\\System32\\\\WindowsPowerShell\\\\v1.0\\\\powershell.exe\" -Command 'Get-Content src/domain/rules/lookup.ts; Get-Content src/domain/rules/types.ts'","aggregated_output":"import type { MemberClass, Section } from '../model/member'\r\nimport type { RuleHit, RulePack } from './types'\r\n\r\n/**\r\n * 烏?.3.6 ??걢?뜰굤?싥걬?삠꺂?믥돶若싥걲?뗥뀻?싨씉餓????앹꽦湲?column.ts)?\r\n * 吏묎퀎湲?quantity/index.ts)媛 諛섎뱶??媛숈? ???遊먯빞 ?섎?濡??⑥씪 異쒖쿂濡??붾떎.\r\n * ?겻툓翁?퐪??겳?믤돮??(?븀쨴?삣쑑訝?깿?먦겘 ADR-005 ?㎯궧?녈꺖?쀥쨼) ???잆겓?γ걮?ゃ걚??\r\n */\r\nexport function coverConditions(\r\n  section: Section,\r\n): Record<string, string | boolean> {\r\n  const cell = {\r\n    memberKind: section.kind,\r\n    soilContact: false,\r\n    finish: section.finish,\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  // 烏?.3.6 ??뚣궧?⒲깣?곮먨뒟鶯곦빳鸚뽧겗鶯곥띹죱??퍞訝듽걩??쐣?▲걽?묆겎?녴걢?뚣곩콏?끹꺕\r\n  // 掠뗥쨼??뙷?γ굮?곥걼?ゃ걚 ???뚣걯烏ⓦ겗?뚧윶?곫쥈?곮먨뒟鶯곥띹죱?ⓩ쭓?졼걣?뺛걝?귙걽?뗣굢\r\n  // 佯딀씮??exposure ?믣뀯?쎼겓?곥걼?싥곥걪?볝겎?귝륫?뺛겒??(ADR-028)??\r\n  return section.kind === '佯딀씮'\r\n    ? cell\r\n    : { ...cell, exposure: section.exposure }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction matches(\r\n  ruleConditions: Record<string, string | number | boolean>,\r\n  queryConditions: Record<string, unknown>,\r\n): boolean {\r\n  return Object.entries(ruleConditions).every(\r\n    ([name, value]) => queryConditions[name] === value,\r\n  )\r\n}\r\n\r\nexport function lookupRule(\r\n  pack: RulePack,\r\n  key: string,\r\n  conditions: Record<string, unknown>,\r\n): RuleHit {\r\n  const candidates = pack.entries.filter(\r\n    (entry) => entry.key === key && matches(entry.conditions, conditions),\r\n  )\r\n\r\n  if (candidates.length === 0) {\r\n    throw new Error(\r\n      `Rule not found: ${key} for ${JSON.stringify(conditions)}`,\r\n    )\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  const specificity = Math.max(\r\n    ...candidates.map((entry) => Object.keys(entry.conditions).length),\r\n  )\r\n  const mostSpecific = candidates.filter(\r\n    (entry) => Object.keys(entry.conditions).length === specificity,\r\n  )\r\n\r\n  if (mostSpecific.length !== 1) {\r\n    throw new Error(\r\n      `Rule lookup is ambiguous: ${key} for ${JSON.stringify(conditions)}`,\r\n    )\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  return mostSpecific[0]\r\n}\r\n\r\n/**\r\n * 媛숈? key?????꾨?瑜?`orderBy` 議곌굔媛믪쓽 ?ㅻ쫫李⑥닚?쇰줈 ?뚮젮以??\r\n *\r\n * ?뷴늽烏?竊덌폆竊됪쥈2))泥섎읆 **?됱쓽 媛쒖닔? ?쒖꽌 ?먯껜媛 洹쒖?**??猷곗뿉 ?대떎. 肄붾뱶媛\r\n * ?뚦뙷?놁? 3媛쒌띾씪怨??뚮㈃ 猷고뙥??諛붽퓭??肄붾뱶媛 ?곕씪?ㅼ? ?딆쑝誘濡? 議고쉶 履쎌씠\r\n * ???꾩껜瑜??쎈뒗??\r\n */\r\nexport function lookupRuleSeries(\r\n  pack: RulePack,\r\n  key: string,\r\n  orderBy: string,\r\n): RuleHit[] {\r\n  const rows = pack.entries.filter((entry) => entry.key === key)\r\n\r\n  if (rows.length === 0) {\r\n    throw new Error(`Rule series not found: ${key}`)\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  return [...rows]\r\n    .map((entry) => {\r\n      const order = entry.conditions[orderBy]\r\n      if (typeof order !== 'number') {\r\n        throw new Error(\r\n          `Rule ${key} must carry a numeric ${orderBy} condition to be ordered`,\r\n        )\r\n      }\r\n      return { entry, order }\r\n    })\r\n    .sort((left, right) => left.order - right.order)\r\n    .map(({ entry }) => entry)\r\n}\r\n\r\nexport function lookupMarkup(\r\n  pack: RulePack,\r\n  memberClass: MemberClass | string,\r\n): RuleHit {\r\n  return lookupRule(pack, 'markup.rate', { memberClass })\r\n}\r\nexport interface ResolvedSource {\r\n  short: string\r\n  doc: string\r\n  edition: string | null\r\n  publisher: string\r\n  url: string | null\r\n  section: string | null\r\n  page: number | null\r\n}\r\n\r\n/**\r\n * 媛믪쓽 洹쇨굅媛 ?대뵒源뚯? ?뺤씤?먮뒗吏. ??異뺤쓽 ?쒖꽌?????꾨줈 媛덉닔濡?媛뺥븯??\r\n *\r\n * - `stated`      ?먮Ц??紐낆떆???덇퀬 **?낅┰ 寃?좉퉴吏 ?앸궗??*.\r\n * - `transcribed` ?먮Ц??紐낆떆???덉쑝??**?꾩궗?먯? ?뱀씤?먭? 媛숇떎** (R6).\r\n *                 湲곌퀎 ?議?怨⑤뱺 ?쎌뒪泥샕룰뎄議?遺덈??????듦낵???곹깭??\r\n * - `inferred`    ?먮Ц??洹?媛믪씠 ?녿떎. 諛섎??댁꽍?닿굅?? ?먮Ц ?먯껜媛 誘명솗蹂대떎.\r\n *\r\n * `transcribed` 瑜??곕줈 ???댁쑀: ?덉쟾?먮뒗 ?뚯썝臾?紐낆떆?몃뜲 寃?좉? 1?멥띻낵\r\n * ?뚯썝臾몄뿉 ?꾩삁 ?놁뼱??吏?대궦 媛믡띿씠 ????`inferred` ??? ?ъ슜?먮뒗 ?섏쓣\r\n * 援щ퀎?????놁뿀怨? 若싩??룔걬 40d 媛숈? ?먮Ц 紐낆떆媛믪씠 ?뚯텛濡졼띿쑝濡??쒖떆?먮떎.\r\n */\r\nexport type RuleConfidence = 'stated' | 'transcribed' | 'inferred'\r\n\r\n/** ?깃툒 ?쒖꽌 ????쓣?섎줉 ?쏀븯?? ??臾띠쓬????쒓컪? 媛???쏀븳 寃껋씠?? */\r\nexport const CONFIDENCE_ORDER: readonly RuleConfidence[] = [\r\n  'inferred',\r\n  'transcribed',\r\n  'stated',\r\n]\r\n\r\nexport interface RuleEntry {\r\n  key: string\r\n  label: string\r\n  expr: string\r\n  conditions: Record<string, string | number | boolean>\r\n  value: number\r\n  unit: string\r\n  source: ResolvedSource\r\n  confidence: RuleConfidence\r\n  note: string\r\n}\r\n\r\nexport type RuleHit = RuleEntry\r\n\r\nexport interface RulePack {\r\n  id: string\r\n  entries: RuleEntry[]\r\n}\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
